cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use TACTC, please cite it as below."
title: "TACTC: Tissue Adjacency Cross-Check of Transcriptomic Clusters"
abstract: "An independent tissue check of spot-level expression clusters and PAGA graphs: expression clusters are built from RNA alone, a nuclear-adjacency graph from the image alone, and the two are crossed to mark contiguous (core) and fragmented (scattered) spots and tissue-annotated PAGA edges."
